			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 12000
			},
			"text": " And I'm here with Mark from Sydney Robot Workshop. Hey Mark, tell us about all the cool robots you got here. What do you guys do? Are you a space where people work on robots in public space?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
