				"to": "00:00:26,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12000,
				"to": 26000
			},
			"text": " Yeah, that's right. We're a space at Gladesville where people can come and build robots. They can be movie robots like R2-D2 here, or they can be serious robots like autonomous robots that we're building here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:26,000",
				"to": "00:00:41,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 26000,
				"to": 41000
			},
			"text": " But what we have here today is obviously a Dalek from Death of the Daleks. 50th anniversary, isn't it? Yes it is. This is a marketing robot that I built for a company that I work for."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,000",
				"to": "00:00:54,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41000,
				"to": 54000
			},
			"text": " It entertains customers. The guy over there in the corner, the yellow and orange and blue guy is Bruce, and he's again kind of a marketing fun robot. You may have seen him on Beauty and the Beast."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:54,000",
